# The document fetched via `portal_api` for driver.py's zero-solution call:
# a hydra:PagedCollection with NO hydra:nextPage triple at all, so
# `next_page = m{ {cur} {hydra:nextPage} ?v }.first()` must come back None
# right away -- exactly what `graph.value(subject=cur,
# predicate=hydra:nextPage)` returns when nothing matches -- and the while
# loop body never runs. No dcat:Dataset subject either, so the final loop's
# `m{ ?d a {DCAT.Dataset} }` also has zero solutions.
@prefix hydra: <http://www.w3.org/ns/hydra/core#> .
@prefix ex: <http://example.org/> .

ex:collection a hydra:PagedCollection .
